{"id":"659302","name":"芦笋炒牛肉","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/659302/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"芦笋","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"牛肉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"牛肉洗净切薄片。","img":"images/659302/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"牛肉加入适量玉米淀粉，蚝油，生抽，抓拌均匀。","img":"images/659302/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入花生油锁住水份抓匀。","img":"images/659302/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"芦笋洗净切小段。","img":"images/659302/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中热油放入牛肉。","img":"images/659302/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"炒至七八成熟后盛出。","img":"images/659302/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅中酱油放入芦笋。","img":"images/659302/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"大火快速翻炒。","img":"images/659302/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"少许盐调味。","img":"images/659302/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"翻炒至断生。","img":"images/659302/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入牛肉。","img":"images/659302/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"大火快速炒匀即可。","img":"images/659302/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659302/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659302/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659302/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659302/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}